{"id":"8bf9fd31-7913-462e-9f91-42d6b74843be","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"ef092e668be2073c","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/build/package-types.ts","baseline":{"blob":"2dde72241f89d2f7e5132943bf67e45a4d7c28d5","start":7199,"end":7232},"shape":{"type":"VariableDeclaration","atoms":["const","ownTypes","=","seedPackage","(","pkg",")"]},"context":{"before":"a4a3e548a9b978a6#1","after":"e94031cb26e72181"}},"payload":{"text":"A package's own types, plus its DefinitelyTyped counterpart (react → @types/react): react/react-dom ship\nno types, so the @types package is what provides the module types AND the global JSX namespace.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:09:50.946Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:09:50.946Z"}
{"id":"94adf0fc-35a2-4d9f-be5d-4344896a59c2","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"b8fa0d6deeaabf34","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/build/package-types.ts","baseline":{"blob":"90e02159fff55fea65d42196d76afc48926c8960","start":4778,"end":4883},"shape":{"type":"If","atoms":["if","(","declBytes","===","0","||","(","declBytes",">","PKG_DECL_CAP","&&","!","pkg",".","startsWith","(","\"","@types/","\"",")",")",")","{","return","undefined",";","}"]},"context":{"before":"8d1cfc4ff764311b","after":"42540a93c65abe64#0"}},"payload":{"text":"ships no types → ambient any; too heavy to bake → CDN + any. @types/* packages ARE the type surface, so\nthey bake regardless of size (shimming them would defeat the point).","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:10:01.074Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:10:01.074Z"}
{"id":"ad631e33-2d92-49f5-93df-ffe52dd63e93","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"6e30f50632d58e14","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/build/package-types.ts","baseline":{"blob":"e4698b53c3693d3b2aa31d27ce9cec3d9d6af2d7","start":8007,"end":8053},"shape":{"type":"VariableDeclaration","atoms":["const","tsconfigDir","=","path",".","join","(","nm",",","\"","@tsconfig","\"",")"]},"context":{"before":"4274ce5a1b608be2","after":"6e7ae4709a7e3b68"}},"payload":{"text":"The tsconfig `extends` base(s): seed the whole (tiny) @tsconfig scope so the extends chain resolves.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:09:45.776Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:09:45.776Z"}
{"id":"afeedfbb-6aab-4a0d-8d3c-d9910d0c0832","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"b211d44c4653dd60","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/build/package-types.ts","baseline":{"blob":"87df284f613db84e85088171a3e30d953b5a95b5","start":696,"end":745},"shape":{"type":"VariableDeclaration","atoms":["const","DECL_SUFFIX","=","[","\"",".d.ts","\"",",","\"",".d.mts","\"",",","\"",".d.cts","\"","]"]},"context":{"before":"abe4a32a323ef574","after":"c9ab8288386e9672"}},"payload":{"text":"The workspace snapshot (snapshot.ts) is browse-only. Without node_modules the workbench's TS language service\ncan't resolve a single import, so every open file lights up with phantom \"Cannot find module\" /\n\"Cannot find name 'process'\" errors. Two cooperating pieces fix it:\n\n  • editorTypesPlugin (`editor:types`)  — SYNCHRONOUSLY seeds the declaration surface (package.json +\n    *.d.ts) of the packages the demo imports, plus the @tsconfig base. The TS worker resolves package.json/exports against a synchronous view an\n    async provider can't populate, so type-checking REQUIRES this up-front seed. Packages that ship\n    no types, are too heavy to bake, or are ambient (vscode) get a one-line `declare module` shim.\n\n  • editorVersionsPlugin (`editor:versions`) — a {name → version} map for the CDN (unpkg) filesystem\n    overlay (node-modules-provider.ts), which lazily fetches FULL package source on demand for\n    go-to-definition/hover into deps. unpkg 302-redirects UNVERSIONED requests without CORS headers,\n    so only pinned packages are servable — hence the map.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:10:13.765Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:10:13.765Z"}
{"id":"c8e67775-cf9e-4981-a350-67f482d5b958","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"14aa23bf38d9d7b0","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/build/package-types.ts","baseline":{"blob":"379dd286f6dcd857e4d69c8f46e4549b774281d9","start":13107,"end":13168},"shape":{"type":"CallExpression","atoms":["res",".","setHeader","(","\"","Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy","\"",",","\"","cross-origin","\"",")"]},"context":{"before":"de3022b71c8d40f9","after":"8736df3d579d32c6"}},"payload":{"text":"Same-origin to the isolated iframe (no CORP strictly needed), but set it to match the prod SW.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:09:25.128Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:09:25.128Z"}
